WEBVTT

00:07.500 --> 00:28.000
Seeing the elites of the Eastern Camp approaching rapidly, Zhu Yuanzhi decisively abandoned the rescue of his comrades, leading the remaining cavalry in retreat.

00:35.640 --> 00:36.280
General

00:36.360 --> 00:37.400
They retreated too quickly

00:37.480 --> 00:39.280
Didn't catch them all

00:41.040 --> 00:42.680
Prince of Jin

00:42.760 --> 00:44.400
That rabbit emperor in the south

00:44.480 --> 00:45.960
Has raised a wolf

00:47.400 --> 00:48.960
Just lost some tents

00:49.280 --> 00:50.947
General Shi's fifty thousand troops

00:51.080 --> 00:51.960
No matter how he schemes

00:52.120 --> 00:52.920
It's just

00:53.000 --> 00:54.400
A breeze brushing fur

00:54.480 --> 00:56.280
What do you know?

00:56.560 --> 00:57.960
When two armies fight

00:58.120 --> 00:59.920
It's all about momentum

01:00.640 --> 01:01.400
The Xuan people's arrows

01:01.480 --> 01:04.040
Have almost all been used on the refugees

01:04.120 --> 01:04.960
Call the craftsmen

01:05.040 --> 01:06.840
The finished catapults

01:06.920 --> 01:07.400
At dawn

01:07.520 --> 01:08.560
Send two units

01:08.640 --> 01:09.600
To attack the city in rotation

01:09.680 --> 01:10.520
On the other side

01:10.600 --> 01:12.000
Work faster too

01:12.120 --> 01:13.920
Yes

01:21.280 --> 01:22.400
Send people out of the city

01:22.480 --> 01:23.760
To recover arrows as much as possible

01:23.840 --> 01:24.560
At the same time

01:24.640 --> 01:26.040
Open the southern grain storehouse

01:26.120 --> 01:28.080
Reward our troops for the successful raid

01:28.160 --> 01:29.400
Have the soldiers

01:29.480 --> 01:31.280
Celebrate together

01:31.480 --> 01:33.280
Yes

01:35.600 --> 01:36.400
This General Zhu

01:36.480 --> 01:37.680
Truly has the courage of a bear and tiger

01:37.760 --> 01:38.840
I saw in the Wunu camp

01:39.000 --> 01:40.000
Flames reaching the sky

01:40.080 --> 01:40.960
Truly satisfying

01:41.040 --> 01:41.800
Pity

01:41.880 --> 01:42.760
Only good food

01:42.840 --> 01:44.120
No wine

01:44.200 --> 01:44.920
I think

01:45.000 --> 01:46.320
This meal is like a last meal

01:46.400 --> 01:48.200
Zhu Yuanzhi showed off

01:48.400 --> 01:49.800
Won't the Wunu retaliate?

01:49.960 --> 01:51.480
Maybe they'll launch a full attack tonight

01:51.560 --> 01:52.880
Lately I

01:52.960 --> 01:53.920
Can't sleep well

01:54.000 --> 01:54.600
Always hear

01:54.680 --> 01:56.400
Thumping sounds

01:56.480 --> 01:57.760
Always dream of Wunu warhorses

01:57.840 --> 01:59.240
Trampling down on me

01:59.400 --> 02:00.680
Shut up and eat

02:00.760 --> 02:01.360
Stop thinking about this and that

02:01.480 --> 02:03.280
Scaring yourself

02:04.000 --> 02:14.880
On the fourth day, the Wunu army bombarded the ramparts with catapults and launched a massive assault with scaling ladders, only gradually retreating at daybreak on the fifth day. The surviving defenders collapsed in exhaustion, having not even the strength to gather the remains of their fallen comrades.

02:14.960 --> 02:16.520
Although we've repelled the enemy

02:16.600 --> 02:18.240
But arrows are exhausted

02:18.320 --> 02:20.320
All kinds of weapons and traps

02:20.480 --> 02:21.880
Are also severely depleted

02:22.040 --> 02:22.600
Also

02:22.680 --> 02:24.200
Need to immediately assign people

02:24.280 --> 02:26.680
To urgently repair the city walls

02:26.920 --> 02:28.040
How many men do we have left?

02:28.120 --> 02:28.960
Heavy casualties

02:29.040 --> 02:31.400
Now only about two thousand can still fight

02:31.480 --> 02:32.480
If the Wunu attack again

02:32.560 --> 02:34.200
At most we can

02:34.280 --> 02:35.400
Hold for two days

02:35.480 --> 02:36.880
Report

02:37.920 --> 02:38.600
There's an army to the south

02:38.680 --> 02:39.920
Approaching us

02:40.000 --> 02:41.920
They don't look like Wunu

02:42.000 --> 02:44.000
Chen Ying's reinforcements have arrived

02:44.480 --> 02:46.480
Let's go take a look

03:06.880 --> 03:08.400
Who goes there?

03:10.360 --> 03:11.840
I'm Liu Dadao

03:12.080 --> 03:14.320
Commander of Yong'an Garrison's Left Army

03:15.200 --> 03:16.280
These

03:16.360 --> 03:19.160
Are all the lords of northern fortresses

03:19.360 --> 03:20.320
Zhang, Huang, Liu, Li

03:20.400 --> 03:21.360
The four great families

03:21.520 --> 03:23.200
Have also come

03:23.280 --> 03:24.680
Although we're in the north

03:24.760 --> 03:25.760
In our hearts

03:25.840 --> 03:28.507
We always recognize the Xuan on this flag

03:28.680 --> 03:31.680
Everyone heard the royal army is trapped in Yiyang

03:31.840 --> 03:33.800
Specially led the northern volunteer army

03:33.880 --> 03:35.680
To come and help

03:39.480 --> 03:40.800
Great Xuan's old subjects

03:40.880 --> 03:42.440
Great Xuan's old subjects

03:42.640 --> 03:44.640
Willing to die for Great Xuan

03:44.760 --> 03:47.000
Willing to die for Great Xuan

03:47.200 --> 03:48.200
It's reinforcements

03:48.280 --> 03:49.680
Our reinforcements

03:52.600 --> 03:53.480
Your Highness

03:53.560 --> 03:55.360
Look

